            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>The patient’s CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count is slightly below the normal range, which may indicate mild immunosuppression or a transient decrease. Clinical correlation is recommended to assess for possible causes such as recent infection, medication effects, or underlying immune disorders. Repeat testing and further evaluation may be warranted if clinically indicated.</td></tr></table></div>"
